3.4 Constraints and what is out of scope

          No live bank, UPI or NPCI data is available to the team. Every labelled result is on synthetic data and says so; the only real data are the public Bitcoin mempool, exchange rates, the UN
          sanctions list and the two IP lists.
          The engine never declines a payment by itself. It returns a band; holding or declining follows the bank's policy (D03).
          Kept as they are: the mule core, alerts, triage, complaints, return fraud, compliance and the GenAI module (advisory only).
          Deferred until measured: Apache Flink, a Neo4j cluster, a GPU graph neural network (6.14).
